: &quot;굴림&quot;\">안내하오니 해당 학생은 지정기한내 학위논문심사 신청을 완료하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 제출대상자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">2009. 8월 대학원 졸업예정자 (졸업요건이 되는 자)</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#696969\"> 가. 수료예정자로서 졸업종합시험에 합격하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은자</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font> <font color=\"#ff1493\">○ 2009-1학기 졸업종합시험발표일 : 2009.4.27(월) 원스톱서비스</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 2009-1학기 수료자등록한 학생</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;</font></span><font color=\"#808080\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">박사과정 졸업예정자 학위논문 학술지 게재 실적제출</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#1e90ff\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">(석사과정생은 해당없음)</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#6a6a6a\">가. 제출기간 : </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 4. 23(목) ~ 4. 24</font><font color=\"#ff1493\">(금)</font> </span>\n</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#808080\">나. 제출장소 : 대학원 각 학과 종합학사행정실</font> </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;￭ 제출논문 조건 : 재학중에 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에 1편 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이상 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ￭ 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ￭ 게재예정인경우 : 게재(예정)증명서1부(게재예정일자가 논문심사완료일(09.6.19)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quo