ff0000\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">(박사 및 석사과정생 모두 해당) </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 제출기간 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><font color=\"#6a6a6a\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 4. 28(화) ~ 4. 30(목)</font></span></font></span></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\"></span></font></span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 : 양식Style0\"&gt;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 논문심사신청서 1부 </span>\n</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 지도교수추천서 1부 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 심사용 논문(석사 : 3부, 박사 : 5부) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 논문심사료 납입영수증(사본가능) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#8b008b\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#8b008b\"> </font></span><font color=\"#8b008b\"><font color=\"#8b008b\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot